  "releaseNotes": "AIKernel.Providers v0.1.1 - Official extension provider set aligned with AIKernel.NET, AIKernel.Core, AIKernel.Control, and AIKernel.Cuda13.0 v0.1.1. Adds ChatOpenAIProvider, ChatHistoryProvider, CudaComputeProvider, AIKernel.Providers.Standard OS driver providers, DynamicPipelineCompilerProvider, LocalLlmProvider, and AIKernel.Providers.MicrosoftAI. MicrosoftAI provider ownership moved from AIKernel.Core to AIKernel.Providers. Includes dynamic provider manifests, bilingual reference documentation, and Python wrapper support.",
